      "content": "thanks, that's a relief. i was kinda worried because the weakness in my arm feels a bit different this time, kinda like it's just not responding right, but i guess it's probably just the aura. i have some sumatriptan leftovers from my last prescription, should i take a double dose or something to just knock this out fast so i can sleep?",
